- op: discuss  # 0cf7
  at: '2026-03-03T06:24:52Z'  # 0cf7
  by: agent  # 0cf7
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 0cf7
  clock: 7  # 0cf7
  nonce: 0cf7  # 0cf7
  message: "Route nodes falling back to hash IDs in compact output (grafana bakeoff) is this invariant violation manifesting. Routes lack proper stable_ids, so compact can't produce resolvable references."  # 0cf7
